     string is inert, but the quoted argument of a {@code url()} reaches this scan after CSS unescaping in the
     browser, so a reference concealed with escapes (e.g. {@code "url(\6javascript:…)"}) cannot hide inside it.
     */
    private boolean stringIsSafe(String value, int from, int end) {
        int i = from;
