 * {@code vbscript:}, and any unknown or undecidable scheme are always rejected; a {@code data:} reference passes
 * only when {@code data} is an explicitly allowed protocol and its media type is inert. Relative references are
 * resolved against the element's document base URI, or kept verbatim when relative links are preserved.
